  "job_B15.1.68_20260920_210314": {
    "chunk_text": "On eallweldandes drihtnes namen \u00fee ealle \u00feing geworhte and him seluum to anwelde hyld, and seld \u00feam Ic edward of his agenum \u00fee he for his godnesse butan minre geearnunge me wealden led. Ic sille and scher cwe\u00f0e widuten ende for minre saule alysednys se ealle \u00fea kirken tunes. Landes, fredomes, ealswa hy hyranuppen on leden gewretene stande\u00f0 in to holme ministere, \u00feam abbete.",
